[{"title":"赋得鸟啼春未足","author":"郭之奇","text":"幽事初微许，风光欲细裁。\n嘤求何物至，栖择为君来。\n落日稀俦侣，空山但草莱。\n烟花谁处烂，不令此声催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得花落梦无聊","author":"郭之奇","text":"长有春来恨，真无可奈何。\n燕泥香未减，蝶粉腻犹多。\n万点随风去，残枝畏月过。\n相思凭寐接，魂断复因他。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春未足应有馀春鸟啼何事","author":"郭之奇","text":"亦知春十九，去日总堪思。\n欲问无穷意，方当未足时。\n可怜枝上语，犹向谷中迷。\n错认烟风浅，频呼细雨吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦无聊犹可寻梦花落堪思","author":"郭之奇","text":"风前时坐立，高下数幽芳。\n草色憎飞片，苔痕惜坠光。\n斜晖犹嘿照，夜雨莫虚飏。\n短梦如堪续，馀心那可忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"筑室谁知夷蹠，买山复见巢由。\n愿招此日猿鹤，颇怪当年鹊鸠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"许国谋身自拙，无家避地犹难。\n今朝独问樵斧，当日虚从钓竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"山色平分草色，风音尽入松音。\n为斯远坐相悦，是以迟留独吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"村树含烟似碧，山花有色无香。\n从春暂假风日，何物堪同雪霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其五","author":"郭之奇","text":"要之目所遥集，凭此心须近安。\n认取方怀一寸，休言世故千端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36104,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其六","author":"郭之奇","text":"扫地焚香一室，孤灯细雨天涯。\n强刲欲爱诸业，自长薰修寸芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36105,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其七","author":"郭之奇","text":"嘿念群疑尽析，匡居一事皆馀。\n任他春色将满，惟我清心日虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36106,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其八","author":"郭之奇","text":"学后方知不足，看来一往无穷。\n古今上下如许，豪圣英贤亦同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36107,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其九","author":"郭之奇","text":"身在山中养晦，心同天汉为光。\n我龙复见于铄，彼织终成报章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36108,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其十","author":"郭之奇","text":"松林自挺孤直，兰谷同飘众芳。\n赖此贞心洁性，分为远地幽光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36109,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其十一","author":"郭之奇","text":"地步前人已占，胸怀我辈须高。\n千秋金镜谁续，此日文心独劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山课即事书怀十二绝 其十二","author":"郭之奇","text":"貌许麟图在阁，声从鹤野闻皋。\n中兴日月千载，万古云霄一毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春去","author":"郭之奇","text":"春去不辞人，人犹念彼春。\n飞花时欲远，啼鸟日相邻。\n此物何堪恨，愁心莫漫嗔。\n尚留形外影，长与共昏晨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36112,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后","author":"郭之奇","text":"竹舍延初旭，荆扉聚晓烟。\n花光零雨后，春色褪风前。\n即见今谁语，所思旧独怜。\n吾将心问口，时亦谓之然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36113,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一鸟","author":"郭之奇","text":"一鸟枝閒语，孤云海上游。\n幸无多应接，亦可恣冥搜。\n物色容牵惹，风光孰止留。\n安能居郁郁，日与世悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36114,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"所遇","author":"郭之奇","text":"所遇他无物，相期别有人。\n乾坤犹日月，身世岂风尘。\n独念今于古，何如夜与昏。\n终当凝我素，或可任其真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36115,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月一日日已夏而候犹春戏作劝春光一篇","author":"郭之奇","text":"春光春光，劝尔且休跨。\n毕竟年年用来，何须三时一假。\n吾不识太皞何居，句芒何舍。\n仰观青阳右个，且愿苍龙止驾。\n几番布气行权，一样承流司化。\n但能和地天平上下，自然句者堪伸萌者堪架。\n岂惮施雨行云，胡为凌冬却夏。\n知尔者以为让成不居，不知者以为避难却卸。\n吾欲迟望舒之窈容，止飞廉之奔泻。\n诏丰隆以津梁，帅初虹而来迓。\n高深一望共萦回，近远同风多乐暇。\n时亦犹其未央，芳亦犹其未罢。\n思邈路之曼曼，及诸荣之未谢。\n莫问九门磔攘，休贪一刻宵价。\n息心且就蓬山阳，水流花落姑停罢。\n不受时情叹怜，所畏骚人怨骂。\n吾将折琼枝而蔽赤华，继之以朝以夜。\n前牵牛使先驱，后婺女使洁舍。\n尽教阳德遍东南，方许高明日亲炙。\n君看万古一春王，安能此月为偏霸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36116,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松风梦","author":"郭之奇","text":"心爱松风清，梦入松风好。\n流烟卷雾出重霄，满天空翠如堪扫。\n海色群飞似碧纹，峰云片落如纤缟。\n吾将攀百尺之长条，蹑苍茫之远昊。\n中逢羽客话蓬壶，偶值青童依渌岛。\n仙乐聚鸣，绮琴独抱。\n高山峨峨，流水浩浩。\n上有花开花落之窈岑，下有春去春留之瑶草。\n鸾歌凤舞共参差，岩呼谷应互倾倒。\n俄魂动而神摇，漫幽寻而嘿讨。\n但闻馀音绕梁，起视窗日犹早。\n吾将今王子之缑笙罢吹，皇娥之梓瑟休考。\n吟飘和兮自调刁，南方来兮却愠恼。\n君不见黄石已去赤松游，商山飒飒馀诸皓。\n冬亦不能为之凋，春亦不能为之老。\n安能从风从雨泰山道，使我侧听心如捣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36117,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓬罗行","author":"郭之奇","text":"晓日欲开蓬山阳，松风飒飒动初光。\n牧子驱牛下侧坂，樵人腰斧向前冈。\n中有山栖閒步客，孤吟小咏立苍茫。\n心爱诸松时结伴，身随樵牧未成行。\n衣无褐，巾是葛。\n逐景寻幽不暂离，微言欲使化工夺。\n眼看春色似烟流，藉草穿林恣远游。\n可怜春尽愁难尽，错认三春春尽愁。\n风光烂熳归何处，斜日西沉东月浮。\n毵毵霁霭横溪径，漠漠飞阴覆钓舟。\n君不见天台采药当时路，云深花散水悠悠。\n水亦不能使花住，花亦不能使人留。\n千岩万壑此恨终，谁见皎皎新轮玉半勾。\n玉勾斜，玉颜遮，朝云已变赤城霞。\n空山不管人间事，春去春来春复花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山花落","author":"郭之奇","text":"空山亦自花，花落倍堪嗟。\n春风何太迷，不忍春光天一涯。\n花知春欲去，春亦不能为花虑。\n一片从风一片留，留向空山有春处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飓风行　乐府","author":"郭之奇","text":"五月四日，海氛又恶。\n田门未高，屈闾将落。\n今古萧条逐逝流，云风震荡奔遥壑。\n一自神州澒洞来，腥尘十载遍人廓。\n鬼神含恨复含悽，天水相遭遂相虐。\n每疑康回凭怒前，或是巨鳌戴山却。\n人言龙伯罢纶归，我畏鸱龟曳衔跃。\n自朝及晡，其势愈搏。\n羲和倦驰，丰隆既蠖。\n吾不知蓱翳之胡从兮，时与飞廉而偕作。\n吾但忧巢处之莫支兮，安知海潮之骤躩。\n狂波十丈自东腾，绿岛迷冥青岫瀹。\n已闻盐户众为鱼，复道水军同化雀。\n五丝续命事如何，满月经营心不乐。\n所畏群生似转蓬，岂向浮居同败箨。\n枕畔啾啾中夜声，眼中飒飒前秋魄。\n前秋今夏何相络，海水天风那可度。\n吾又安能问水滨，海水自强人自弱。\n何时蹄迹去中原，居人慎莫邻蛟鳄。\n吾亦因之谢海若，胡为实逼处此以与海若争此涯角水风之大橐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月十三□□去廉因作廉□逃一篇且愿有事于廉者瞻前顾后相留意于斯言　乐府","author":"郭之奇","text":"飞廉飞廉，错认三廉是汝乡。\n秋去春来逾鬼蜮，髡头削臂称犬羊。\n尔贯既盈时乃至，中天旭日既当阳。\n已传面缚皆酋首，复道输诚化假王。\n千条汉帜标玄菟，十路天兵断白狼。\n尔归何地逃何所，此民何罪供尔戕。\n尔纵戕民民尚有，一二鸠形脱剑铓。\n或疑城旦辞舂市，谁沐猿猴出近岗。\n欲言未言气屡绝，自言三日奔道旁。\n尚忆去年秋九月，□归不似此苍皇。\n西顾钦灵东化石，未闻一矢遥相当。\n此如穷寇谁追掩，此如鸟兽乍惊翔。\n始知天意从人意，□之亡也实天亡。\n天亡骄子终弗恤，人非族类自相妨。\n我见天人应不远，瞻前顾后几徊徨。\n非仁胡服，非义胡昌。\n人之所去，天曷可长。\n凡百君子，视彼无良。\n省厥干戈，念尔衣裳。\n鹤在轩而丧卫，鱼已烂而亡梁。\n作善降之百祥，作不善降之百殃。\n书有明训，命不干常。\n谁为此言，满室满堂。\n以暴易暴，不臧厥臧。\n君不见去秋土官土弁今何在，青史不收血异苌。\n彼人不幸而为今人嗤也，戒之哉，后事之资前岂忘。\n嗟我何人独永伤，愿操长矢尽欃枪。\n手援北斗酌桂浆，自西自南以东行。\n三春目极怀千里，六月徂署抱秋霜。\n安能含思郁郁长居此，使我不得伸愁肠。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡无人四首 其一 念汉武雄才及卫霍远略","author":"郭之奇","text":"龙塞迢迢界豕狼，狼居山下书牛羊。\n自从鸣镝誇风雨，岂念天兵似日霜。\n将军始携古贤入，票姚仍选轻骑集。\n已过祁连胡畜衰，既取焉支胡妇泣。\n幕南王庭安在哉，天子北登单于台。\n单于台，未央阙，不悬胡头蓄胡发。\n胡歌绿管配，胡舞白题斜。\n胡无人，汉一家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36122,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡无人四首 其二 念唐宗壮志及英卫殊猷","author":"郭之奇","text":"聊命偏师擒首王，始弘庙略扫穷荒。\n临边自将休誇汉，雪耻除凶独颂唐。\n百万齐归古未及，灵州复继燕然立。\n已见苏尼举众来，俄看敕勒求朝入。\n胡越一家事若何，未央宫内共婆娑。\n共婆娑，俱戎索，一自阴山斥大漠。\n西北诸君长，可汗尽归天。\n胡无人，自此年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36123,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡无人四首 其三 念宗韩岳刘忠勇无二岳不幸而诸酋酌酒宋高视前有恧矣","author":"郭之奇","text":"唾手燕云事若何，背嵬五百未须多。\n直抵黄龙方痛饮，会看白铠自奔波。\n当年只道趯城易，今日翻惊撼山异。\n岂惟连捷称大仪，更闻顺昌标远帜。\n两河忠义日喁喁，结砦连珠复继宗。\n复继宗，群归岳，南北佥军谁敢角。\n且言柺子铁，何似札刀麻。\n胡无人，又呼爷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36124,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡无人四首 其四 念今日中兴德威当跨宋而方唐及汉","author":"郭之奇","text":"天为中土断胡尘，长城万里赖强秦。\n自从伊雒多殊种，复见春秋有雁臣。\n几度戎心窥近阙，一朝蟊贼开边窟。\n神州十载蔽穹庐，四海伤心变肤发。\n胡贯既盈周德长，天戈指日荡胡霜。\n荡胡霜，扫胡雪，星驰雷动犁胡穴。\n封狼临瀚海，勒燕过金微。\n胡无人，尔何归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36125,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"晓驱童竖向遥岗，暮约茅茨动夕阳。\n但使烟霞堪寄托，不妨猿鸟共行藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36126,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"即看云影下山扉，漫许云光出翠微。\n小搆何须求大木，疏篱尚可囿群菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36127,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"披衣及晓赴初光，山课催人亦太忙。\n一路芜烟须尽扫，满空松雪正飞扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36128,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"网薜为帷尽一丘，攀松作盖聊淹留。\n独当远岫开风榭，兼向烟涛出钓舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36129,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其五","author":"郭之奇","text":"为爱前峰递晓青，科头尽日理荒庭。\n每从樵斧开山秽，欲今渔歌动渚馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36130,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其六","author":"郭之奇","text":"欲罢长勤谢懒童，不妨微雨趁朝风。\n平分岸草舒遥绿，细浥园花注小红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其七","author":"郭之奇","text":"行吟不外数峰间，深谷无人鸟共还。\n更获渔樵成此舍，忽忘云树是他山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36132,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其八","author":"郭之奇","text":"卑栖已足蔽图书，展帙朝朝幸有馀。\n千载相关何许事，百年如寄此谁居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36133,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其九","author":"郭之奇","text":"此中不足外人言，未必桃溪异此源。\n我爱其幽君莫问，空山亦自有真存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36134,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重葺山居十绝 其十","author":"郭之奇","text":"三径无人独闭关，青山有意就馀閒。\n牛羊草际时同往，鸡犬云中不记还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36135,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天涯","author":"郭之奇","text":"天涯幽事未全空，窈谷清思亦自浓。\n一片云光生灭处，四围山色有无中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36136,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心远","author":"郭之奇","text":"心远方思出世樊，斯晨斯夕共芳荪。\n云风以外他何物，山水之间别可论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36137,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不厌","author":"郭之奇","text":"不厌前山爱此山，松吹偏向此中閒。\n便教碧草分遥色，长与幽人照晓颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36138,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望海","author":"郭之奇","text":"望海移情惜旧群，在山远志问谁分。\n且留谷鸟同幽树，未许馀人共白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36139,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忽忆","author":"郭之奇","text":"忽忆家园在眼无，荷舒兰茂复谁俱。\n不嫌荏苒归迟客，秋色相留俟远夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36140,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除草","author":"郭之奇","text":"未必愁心减，应求刺眼稀。\n安能需雨蔓，复使怨人归。\n逼处真而罪，芟除莫我非。\n前山无数碧，相对岂无违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36141,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季夏朔天大雷电以雨","author":"郭之奇","text":"檐光无间歇，一望总同云。\n山海情初合，龙螭势几分。\n奔涛交霹雳，骤雨失氤氲。\n不睹空谷容，安知物象纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36142,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连雨未息即见漫成","author":"郭之奇","text":"高轩当雨岫，氛霭望中盈。\n湿鸟频舒翅，风松共落声。\n奔泉千壑竞，涨海一潮平。\n幽事凭谁说，群蛙莫漫鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36143,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居","author":"郭之奇","text":"遭乱愁羁局，山居觅静偏。\n长歌怀渌水，远意托幽泉。\n近识云风始，时当雾雨前。\n浮阴虽四塞，亦自有重玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨馀望初月","author":"郭之奇","text":"初月遇高岑，微光那可寻。\n雨馀垂澹潋，松杪挹清深。\n窈谷虚无外，空庭物象沉。\n且留来夜色，暂许白云阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步屧","author":"郭之奇","text":"雨馀苔草乱，举目畏榛芜。\n豺虎人遥说，蛙蛇仆惯驱。\n祇怜苍径没，惟有绿云俱。\n步屧随昏旦，幽居一事无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荒圃","author":"郭之奇","text":"饥奴不可呼，荒圃任其芜。\n雨过云光湿，泉居地脉腴。\n草骄难独理，瓜蔓俟人扶。\n自笑时多失，赧颜愧野夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新霁","author":"郭之奇","text":"飘零缃帙在，为尔念灰尵。\n启户延新霁，缘阶去溽苔。\n日兼风共扫，云与雾初裁。\n飒飒诸松外，山容次第开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝思","author":"郭之奇","text":"积雨犹堪断，浮生亦未沉。\n千峰凌暑气，万壑动秋心。\n映草波长绿，颓云壁半阴。\n青朝思暂豁，独坐稍栖寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓬栖","author":"郭之奇","text":"人亦有言，心远地偏。\n时心既缺，道心乃全。\n损之又损，玄之又玄。\n门于众妙，宅此深坚。\n辞喧入静，羃翠开烟。\n取予情性，作尔林泉。\n白云芳草，相视曰然。\n我知二物，亦可千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水之閒","author":"郭之奇","text":"宇宙虽遐，古今若寄。\n高深何物，天地所遗。\n水山之閒，是当有异。\n仁者见仁，智者见智。\n余及水山，与亭为四。\n形则万殊，情本一致。\n幽谷相求，玄迹多秘。\n退而寻之，乃获其至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空山十首 其一 山有云","author":"郭之奇","text":"山中何有，云在其中。\n以光为影，以色为空。\n我观其变，变乃无穷。\n以今萧索，出古鸿濛。\n用汝作霖，汝昌厥功。\n在山者独，在天者同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空山十首 其二 山有松","author":"郭之奇","text":"斯晨斯夕，向谷舒情。\n何石堪语，有松自鸣。\n玄霜独抱，景风是迎。\n山泉竞落，海潮罢行。\n我闻其远，潜真遗荣。\n悠悠人世，孰求此声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空山十首 其三 山有泉","author":"郭之奇","text":"我思诸泉，首标正直。\n嗟兹一勺，涵山之德。\n虽无异源，亦表殊色。\n高人可漱，下民所食。\n回壑奔溪，宗海是力。\n谓彼百川，同此无息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空山十首 其四 山有鸟","author":"郭之奇","text":"山鸟维何，山经匪一。\n缅彼殊姿，空俦凡质。\n何翮冲天，奚羽拂日。\n风去雨还，烟栖雾昵。\n蒿篱之下，尚可类悉。\n我念冥飞，终非尔匹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空山十首 其五 山有花","author":"郭之奇","text":"空山有花，空山自誇。\n空山护惜，幽人叹嗟。\n从风从雨，映日飞霞。\n花光相继，山色相赊。\n花开花落，莫我心遐。\n谁堪远赠，念此微华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":36156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]